MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dialer: ClientHandler::connect_egress (egress: token, RemoteOpener with EgressPolicy,
TCP legs only). Acceptor: ServerHandler::with_reverse_egress registry, ExitMode
(Local/Prefer/Require, fail closed), flows routed over a MeshPeerSession view.
Default policy refuses loopback/private/link-local/CGNAT/metadata targets.
open_via_mesh bridge extracted into bridge_via_peer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
